ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine 6 unique materials and craft them into advanced components.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455780/extras/9eea940f45ed91a308cd455da907048b.poster.avif?t=1771181239\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455780/extras/9eea940f45ed91a308cd455da907048b.webm?t=1771181239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455780/extras/9eea940f45ed91a308cd455da907048b.mp4?t=1771181239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research dozens of permanent upgrades in a sprawling tech tree.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455780/extras/4ea9f24e7c8dfb76b43da217a881672c.poster.avif?t=1771181239\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455780/extras/4ea9f24e7c8dfb76b43da217a881672c.webm?t=1771181239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455780/extras/4ea9f24e7c8dfb76b43da217a881672c.mp4?t=1771181239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and enhance around 10 module types, including lasers, thrusters, tractor beams, drones, and shields.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455780